{"id": 21451, "title": "An email —— Thank You for Helping Me Move", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "an-email-thank-you-for-helping-me-move", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/21451_an-email-thank-you-for-helping-me-move.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["寄件人： zhangyi@email.com", "收件人： yangchen@email.com", "日期： 2025 年8 月12 日星期二上午11 : 0", "主题： 谢谢你帮我搬家", "小杨，", "你好！", "谢谢你上周末帮我搬家， 你一定累坏了吧。 我刚到这个城市， 没有很多朋友， 对这里的环境也不熟悉。 你给了我很多帮助和温暖， 真的非常感谢你！", "这个周末我想请你来我的新家吃饭。 我们可以一起聊天、 听音乐。 你喜欢吃什么菜？ 我中餐、 西餐都会做。", "希望你能来。", "盼复！", "张一"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["寄件人： zhangyi@email.com", "收件人： yangchen@email.com", "日期： 2025 年8 月12 日星期二上午11 : 0", "主題： 謝謝你幫我搬家", "小楊，", "你好！", "謝謝你上週末幫我搬家， 你一定累壞了吧。 我剛到這個城市， 沒有很多朋友， 對這裡的環境也不熟悉。 你給了我很多幫助和溫暖， 真的非常感謝你！", "這個週末我想請你來我的新家吃飯。 我們可以一起聊天、 聽音樂。 你喜歡吃什麼菜？ 我中餐、 西餐都會做。", "希望你能來。", "盼復！", "張一"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["jì jiàn rén： zhangyi@email.com", "shōu jiàn rén： yangchen@email.com", "rì qī： 2025  nián 8  yuè 12  rì Xīng qī èr shàng wǔ 11 : 0", "zhǔ tí：  xiè xie nǐ bāng wǒ bān jiā", "Xiǎo Yáng，", "nǐ hǎo！", "xiè xie nǐ shàng zhōu mò bāng wǒ bān jiā，  nǐ yī dìng lèi huài le ba。  wǒ gāng dào zhè gè chéng shì，  méi yǒu hěn duō péng you，  duì zhè lǐ de huán jìng yě bù shú xi。  nǐ gěi le wǒ hěn duō bāng zhù hé wēn nuǎn，  zhēn de fēi cháng gǎn xiè nǐ！", "zhè gè zhōu mò wǒ xiǎng qǐng nǐ lái wǒ de xīn jiā chī fàn。  wǒ men kě yǐ yī qǐ liáo tiān、  tīng yīn yuè。  nǐ xǐ huan chī shén me cài？  wǒ zhōng cān、  xī cān dōu huì zuò。", "xī wàng nǐ néng lái。", "pàn fù！", "Zhāng Yī"], "english_paragraphs": ["Sender: zhangyi@email.com", "Recipient: yangchen@email.com", "Date: Tuesday, August 12, 2025 11:00 AM", "Subject: Thank you for helping me move", "Xiao Yang,", "Hello!", "Thank you for helping me move last weekend. You must have been exhausted! I’ve only just arrived in this city, so I don’t have many friends yet, and I’m still getting used to the area. You’ve helped me so much and made me feel welcome. Thank you so much!", "I’d like to invite you to my new home for dinner this weekend. We can chat and listen to music. What kind of food do you like? I can cook both Chinese and Western food.", "Hope you can come.", "Looking forward to recovery!", "Zhang Yi"], "english_full": "Sender: zhangyi@email.com\n\nRecipient: yangchen@email.com\n\nDate: Tuesday, August 12, 2025 11:00 AM\n\nSubject: Thank you for helping me move\n\nXiao Yang,\n\nHello!\n\nThank you for helping me move last weekend. You must have been exhausted! I’ve only just arrived in this city, so I don’t have many friends yet, and I’m still getting used to the area. You’ve helped me so much and made me feel welcome. Thank you so much!\n\nI’d like to invite you to my new home for dinner this weekend. We can chat and listen to music. What kind of food do you like? I can cook both Chinese and Western food.\n\nHope you can come.\n\nLooking forward to recovery!\n\nZhang Yi", "vocabulary": [{"word": "", "pinyin": "jì jiàn rén", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "shōu jiàn rén", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "rì qī", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "nián", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "yuè", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "rì", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "Xīng qī èr", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "shàng wǔ", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "zhǔ tí", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "xiè xie", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "nǐ", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "bāng", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "wǒ", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "bān", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "jiā", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "Xiǎo Yáng", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "nǐ hǎo", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"wor